Package: aridRUSLE
Title: Soil Erosion Risk Analysis for Semi-Arid Regions
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Sofia", "Zaruchas", , "sofia.zaruchas@stud-mail.uni-wuerzburg.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description:Implements a modified RUSLE approach for soil erosion risk 
    analysis in semi-arid and arid regions using rainfall erosivity (R), 
    topographic influence (LS), and vegetation cover (C) derived from 
    freely available remote sensing and climate data.
